  "display_name": "Etherealness",
  "display_fullname": "Pool Invisibility Phase Shift",
  "display_help": "You can use Etherealness to fall out of sync with material space. Although you do not become completely invisible, you are translucent and hard to see. You gain a significant bonus to defense and resistance versus physical damage while intangible, but you also become limited in your ability to deal physical damage. You cannot remain Ethereal for more than 30 seconds, so you need to make your time in this state count!",
